      "jp": "潮風に吹かれながら砂浜を歩いていると、\n突然、後ろから声がした。",
      "jp_sha256": "05f734b28da2e6dbe8eb4b49d152b8cbe4bfde05e5fdfd08aa17dbe20025fbaa",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "바닷바람을 맞으며 모래사장을 걷고 있는데\n갑자기 뒤에서 목소리가 들렸다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "493fd3a1662a70135262b0014c32f467e1ff5f2ebd942bb8dc46d50a173b099f:000000_-5433343029709900887:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "潮風に吹かれながら砂浜を歩いていると、\n突然、後ろから声がした。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "58e8ddebd8cbe611aad903c10595b74778cc59e08c065bd96eabf9f3f7a6f58a",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "主さま。この海にはね、幻のオアシスがあるのよ。\n誰も見つけたことのない、ふわふわでぽよぽよした心の休息所。\nあたし、それを“ふわすとらりあ”って呼んでるの。",
      "jp_sha256": "8e445a9a6c241c3cf9b7e736a909270b7bbcf7d2fdef1e2b7a9e9bbe510431fb",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "주인님. 이 바다에는 말이야, 환상의 오아시스가 있단다.\n아무도 찾아낸 적 없는 폭신폭신하고 말랑말랑한 마음의 휴식처.\n나는 그걸 「후와스트랄리아」라고 부르고 있어.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "493fd3a1662a70135262b0014c32f467e1ff5f2ebd942bb8dc46d50a173b099f:000000_-5433343029709900887:g0:r11",
      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
