      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "水着姿のリデルさんが、\nいつものように紅茶を片手に微笑んでいる。",
      "jp_sha256": "3625655bcec1d2739685374b14b205a78e8cf59851800de68ace44f248c42746",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "수영복 차림의 리델 씨가\n평소처럼 한 손에 홍차를 들고 미소 짓고 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 13,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "493fd3a1662a70135262b0014c32f467e1ff5f2ebd942bb8dc46d50a173b099f:000000_-5433343029709900887:g0:r12",
      "row_index_0based": 12,
      "serialized_row_index": 12,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "水着姿のリデルさんが、\nいつものように紅茶を片手に微笑んでいる。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "9689f3f8241d4d4b426ad5c5e52306451c2318a7c4191eaeca4dde188387c7b2",
