    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "db751909b38106335bb52bd8de2309f72cbbd7e02878450c04237f1be0fbd18d",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そういう問題！？　と思いつつ、\nリデルさんのペースに巻き込まれるように歩き始める。",
      "jp_sha256": "bb5e0023d97bfcb67b55c9444eebb3c7a1b2b808ab5e9f4f4f01d22835b44fc2",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그런 문제였어요!? 싶었지만\n리델 씨의 흐름에 휩쓸리듯 걷기 시작했다.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 19,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "493fd3a1662a70135262b0014c32f467e1ff5f2ebd942bb8dc46d50a173b099f:000000_-5433343029709900887:g0:r18",
      "row_index_0based": 18,
      "serialized_row_index": 18,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そういう問題！？　と思いつつ、\nリデルさんのペースに巻き込まれるように歩き始める。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a269c6b77eb4b918d86f27d2f94b2f28e9d0b8720f063f286eeb1c33e54ececb",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "リデルさんと並んで、太陽を背に砂浜を歩いた。\n波が静かに寄せては返し、\n足元には白い貝殻がぽつぽつと転がっている。",
      "jp_sha256": "b4017bd06bb57f61a96979147160e7e262cd55ad4e9f3dec178437574b8bd50f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "리델 씨와 나란히 태양을 등지고 모래사장을 걸었다.\n파도는 조용히 밀려왔다 돌아가고\n발밑에는 하얀 조개껍데기가 드문드문 굴러다녔다.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 35,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
