        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "リデルさんと並んで、太陽を背に砂浜を歩いた。\n波が静かに寄せては返し、\n足元には白い貝殻がぽつぽつと転がっている。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "09a083dac010c1b91e671a9ee0e04f583386eef8f105ff39b872fa6f77cb6137",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "次の鍵。“貝殻の囁きを聞く”こと。耳をすますの。\n“しゃべるしぇる”って呼ばれてるのよ、ここの貝たちは。",
      "jp_sha256": "ed57f1fd52a6c3d48dab6a8215e087786cc916fc4bf91bfcf51857b1332cd85a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "다음 열쇠. 「조개껍데기의 속삭임을 듣는 것」. 귀를 기울이렴.\n이곳 조개들은 「말하는 셸」이라고 불린단다.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 36,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
